{"job_id":"F-57580e35386be8a2b61a","family_id":"F-57580e35386be8a2b61a","title":"국회의원청가및결석에관한규칙","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006021-35778-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":14,"target_id":"db35007affec720f9ea5cc74985c97599bb0d5c3a57d4ff957db9aa8df2705b1","source_hash":"682b68800fcc1322e40f92448b3a2681eaac3f3cecf7bf5e971356c9785c89cb","text":"国民议会议员休假和缺席规则"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006021-35778-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":106,"target_id":"4f8e7fb3c312fc458b6ca485d17d3db240969842daf9ce1dec82223c62725609","source_hash":"548f4e4b7d18e0b9299b83c542b2a90ea73cad02bf3941042255b81d6d9d1370","text":"第一条（目的）本规则的目的是根据《国民议会法》第三十二条第三款的规定，规定国民议会议员（以下简称“议员”）请假和缺席的必要事项。<1995年3月18日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006021-35778-ko","scope":"BODY","start":106,"end":185,"target_id":"bf8668417a030cb718ca9eb6b2afabdc65969c0e53852fc2d2c5b52c7b7ec7eb","source_hash":"8be10ff591770beb474d3163ed8116d8c315d4c7de0cfbb7919eac665f1cb63a","text":"第二条（提交委任书）国民议会议员因意外事故无法出席国民议会时，应当事先向议长提交委任书，说明原因和期限。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006021-35778-ko","scope":"BODY","start":185,"end":234,"target_id":"eadd809d456129b5ded3a8e099a029c87edc1ae96e29c2a1a9c76e2a23b9f153","source_hash":"1371a4d61a6dacb6653db83e3ddfb1ff1979d29082fcb21192a74d1eb54da754","text":"第三条（请假）主席应当批准成员请假。<1995年3月18日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006021-35778-ko","scope":"BODY","start":234,"end":316,"target_id":"4670953fb3d8984106062c3da38c93ce2db3d477990fd77d7753d623cf485ed4","source_hash":"166958959dc2b88cb8d728f16297a49156fe4cd994f6e824001f43f907e84cbe","text":"第四条（请假通知）委员请假获准时，主席应当通知委员所属委员会；委员请假不获准时，主席应当通知委员本人。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006021-35778-ko","scope":"BODY","start":316,"end":384,"target_id":"7d40db3ebaf42f2d0ebcb3f3b0176567aa37ad9a6bf1ea6f53385d6e1a990e2d","source_hash":"528d0bbc05b26320883f5cc9ff1a6128c3b93da0452dcb19c0a440325a1915c4","text":"第五条（重新提交休假申请）国民议会议员休假期满后仍无法出席国民议会的，应当重新提交休假申请。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00007","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006021-35778-ko","scope":"BODY","start":384,"end":464,"target_id":"50bb510b7c5fc3744911f36f584e83251eeacccc448cc9ff21c040e555d4d09d","source_hash":"8d57127a7512153c48fe40663b4b10f337d63866b583bcf572d6e882a71446c5","text":"第六条（休假许可的失效） 已获准休假的国民议会议员，如在休假期间出席国民议会，则休假许可自该日起失效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00008","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006021-35778-ko","scope":"BODY","start":464,"end":536,"target_id":"f32628580790198b86d3294b4a003368c3d708fdf2c2142f13017f765b0707f5","source_hash":"50d4243cc1b93f160a77cf8ab14c3cfdf9db6988c7a347b340c0febc04e6884a","text":"第七条（缺席报告）国民议会议员因意外事故无法出席国民议会时，应当向议长提交缺席报告，说明缺席原因和缺席时间。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00009","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006021-35778-ko","scope":"BODY","start":536,"end":621,"target_id":"f35d6b27c689a7cf3dfaf0c02c277d6fd3cabcb5b4983f739bec05ac51aae0a6","source_hash":"da2b9660596eed89f9b087e45dbf6add1ddba2b45bc5e11634c290f44a625807","text":"第8条（发出传唤）议员无正当理由连续两天或两天以上缺席全体会议或委员会会议的，议长或主席应当发出传唤。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00010","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006021-35778-ko","scope":"BODY","start":621,"end":667,"target_id":"f68c959782e3734956e4eabf6c8d39713fe453ea477ce4355e4191c613d67fa5","source_hash":"c0db6311bd645db9e4a4092850c42cb3c377ebcfe889a5a5469ab89191f7e2dc","text":"补充规定 <第5号，1964年4月8日>\n\n该规定自1964年4月6日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00011","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006021-35778-ko","scope":"BODY","start":667,"end":717,"target_id":"e7dd279ed7e5ceeea6ce7d4dd09847ba2947eddd52eaa4f8d587ce4f5b279681","source_hash":"ee7797b415ff7ab80485043f135f8b84f4219cad69082079cb7e71b4ea65b4f0","text":"补充规定 <第5号，1973年11月30日>\n\n本规则自1973年11月30日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00012","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006021-35778-ko","scope":"BODY","start":717,"end":757,"target_id":"3a2e5a27e269552b81c7032005324256b1dbe92043b903896b88e9910874e2d2","source_hash":"71261bd364babe4690419e1b130c07d2260077fce22d494ffd6366f89b351eea","text":"补充规定 <1995年3月18日第90号>\n\n本规则自决议通过之日起生效。"}]}